{"Title":"An Act ensuring access to state IDs for low-income people","BillNumber":"H3456","DocketNumber":"HD1049","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"S_G2","Name":"Steven Ultrino","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/S_G2","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T10:18:08.08"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"S_G2","Name":"Steven Ultrino","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/S_G2","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T10:18:08.08"},{"Id":"V_H1","Name":"Vanna Howard","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/V_H1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-31T17:00:42.2566667"},{"Id":"jml0","Name":"Jason M. Lewis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/jml0","ResponseDate":"2023-02-02T15:49:26.42"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3456/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Ultrino of Malden, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3456) of Steven Ultrino, Vanna Howard and Jason M. Lewis relative to the fees for application for certain drivers' licenses and state identification cards for non-drivers.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 8 of Chapter 90 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended, in line 201, by inserting after the words \"age of 70.\" the following sentence:-\r\n\tNo fees associated with an application for a license shall be charged for a person at or below 300 per cent of the federal poverty guidelines.\r\n\tSECTION 2. Section 8E of said chapter is hereby amended, in line 78, by inserting after the words \"age of 70.\" the following sentence:-\r\n\tNo fees associated with an application for an identification card shall be charged for a person at or below 300 per cent of the federal poverty guidelines.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}